      "text": "BUILDING_LINUX.md gives separate package commands for Debian/Ubuntu, Fedora, openSUSE, and Arch/Manjaro. The Debian command includes protobuf-compiler and libxcb1-dev; Fedora includes libxcb-devel. Its Arch command uses shaderc, while Debian, Fedora, and openSUSE list glslc."
